  CVE-2026-32926|2026-04-01T23:17:02.960|2026-04-01T23:17:02.960|8.4|HIGH|CWE-125|N/A|false|V-SFT versions 6.2.10.0 and prior contain an out-of-bounds read vulnerability in VS6ComFile!load_link_inf. Opening a crafted V7 file may lead to information disclosure from the affected product.|https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-32926|0.00000|0.00000|5.8800
